        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Lampas ground- yellow and green leaves\nBrocade - flowers and fruits\nLancé - metallic threads.  The contrast of silver and gold areas suggests shadings.\nWarp: white, yellow\nWeft: orange, green, and dark brown (?), yellow\nSilver = silver metallic threads night-lighted with white silk\ngold = silver frisé with gold gilt lamé\nSelvedge on both sides with eleven cords.  Spotted, blacks rotted out."@en ;
